RFMIP data: one derived table ships, the RFMIP files do not

gpuwm_data/data/rrtmgp/rrtmgp-trace-gas-climatology.json holds 136
numbers derived from the RFMIP clear-sky input file produced by the
University of Colorado for RFMIP (CMIP6 input4MIPs, UColorado-RFMIP-1-2):
the experiment-zero global-mean mole fractions of sixteen well-mixed gases
and the median layer pressure and ozone profile over its 100 sites. That
file's embedded licence attribute names CC-BY-SA-4.0 and links the
CC-BY-4.0 deed; the derived table is offered under CC-BY-SA-4.0, the
stricter reading, whose text ships beside it at
gpuwm_data/data/rrtmgp/LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0. The Apache-2.0 grant in the
LICENSE file does not extend to that table.

The RFMIP files themselves are in neither this distribution nor its
source repository: the input file, and the four clear-sky reference
results, which are CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 (non-commercial). The tests that read
them fetch them at test time from rrtmgp-data v1.9, SHA-256 verified
(gpuwm/core/rfmip_upstream.py in gpuwm).

