Map assets: Natural Earth and US Census cartographic boundaries

gpuwm_data/data/basemap/ holds the geography the renderer draws on every
picture. natural_earth_10m/ and natural_earth_110m/ are Natural Earth
layers (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/), which Natural Earth places in
the public domain. us_counties_5m/ is the US Census Bureau's
cb_2023_us_county_5m cartographic boundary file, a work of the United
States Government and not subject to copyright in the United States
(17 U.S.C. 105). No redistribution condition attaches to either. The
upstream archives are named in each directory's README and in
gpuwm_data/data/basemap/PROVENANCE.md.

